    "title": "polyplugc",
    "version": "0.1.3",
    "description": "Cross-platform dotnet tool that bundles the polyplugc CLI. Generates host/guest bindings from .toml contract definitions. Fully offline — polyplugc binaries for linux-x64, macos-arm64, and win-x64 are embedded in the package."
